  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.1.10": "(Saṃghād., VIII.2) . . . appatīto hoti. ||1|| ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.1": "aññabhāgiyassa adhikaraṇassā 'ti, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.2": "āpattaññabhāgiyaṃ vā hoti adhikaraṇaññabhāgiyaṃ vā. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.3": "kathaṃ adhikaraṇaṃ adhikaraṇassa aññabhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.4": "vivādādhikaraṇaṃ anuvādādhikaraṇassa āpattādhikaraṇassa kiccādhikaraṇassa aññabhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.5": "anuvādādhikaraṇaṃ . . ., ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.6": "āpattādhikaraṇaṃ . . ., ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.7": "kiccādhikaraṇaṃ vivādādhikaraṇassa anuvādādhikaraṇassa āpattādhikaraṇassa aññabhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.8": "evaṃ adhikaraṇaṃ adhikaraṇassa aññabhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.9": "kathaṃ adhikaraṇaṃ adhikaraṇassa tabbhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.10": "vivādādhikaraṇaṃ vivādādhikaraṇassa tabbhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.11": "anuvādādhikaraṇaṃ anuvādādhikaraṇassa tabbhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.12": "āpattādhikaraṇaṃ āpattādhikaraṇassa siyā tabbhāgiyaṃ siyā aññabhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.13": "kathaṃ āpattādhikaraṇaṃ āpattādhikaraṇassa aññabhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.14": "methunadhammapārājikāpatti adinnādānapārājikāpattiyā manussaviggahapārājikāpattiyā uttarimanussadhammapārājikāpattiyā aññabhāgiyā. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.15": "adinnādānapārājikāpatti . . ., ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.16": "manussaviggahapārājikāpatti . . ., ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.17": "uttarimanussadhammapārājikāpatti methunadhammapārājikāpattiyā adinnādānapārājikāpattiyā manussaviggahapārājikāpattiyā aññabhāgiyā. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.18": "evaṃ āpattādhikaraṇaṃ āpattādhikaraṇassa aññabhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.19": "kathañ ca āpattādhikaraṇaṃ āpattādhikaraṇassa tabbhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.20": "methunadhammapārājikāpatti methunadhammapārājikāpattiyā ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.21": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.22": "tabbhāgiyā . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.23": "uttarimanussadhammapārājikāpatti uttarimanussadhammapārājikāpattiyā tabbhāgiyā. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.24": "evaṃ āpattādhikaraṇaṃ āpattādhikaraṇassa tabbhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.25": "kiccādhikaraṇaṃ kiccādhikaraṇassa tabbhāgiyaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.2.26": "evaṃ adhikaraṇaṃ adhikaraṇassa tabbhāgiyaṃ. ||2|| ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.1": "kiñci desaṃ lesamattaṃ upādāyā 'ti. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.2": "leso nāma dasa lesā: jātileso nāmaleso gottaleso liṅgaleso āpattileso pattaleso cīvaraleso upajjhāyaleso ācariyaleso senāsanaleso. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.3": "jātileso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.4": "khattiyo diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ ajjhāpajjanto, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.5": "aññaṃ khattiyaṃ passitvā codeti: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.6": "khattiyo mayā diṭṭho, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.7": "pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ ajjhāpanno 'si, asamaṇo ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.8": "'si, asakyaputtiyo 'si, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.9": "n' atthi tayā saddhiṃ uposatho vā pavāraṇā vā saṃghakammaṃ vā 'ti, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.10": "āpatti vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.11": "brāhmaṇo diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.12": "vesso diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.13": "suddo diṭṭho hoti . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.14": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.15": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.16": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.17": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.18": "āpatti vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.19": "nāmaleso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.20": "Buddharakkhito diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.21": "Dhammarakkhito diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.22": "Saṃgharakkhito diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ ajjhāpajjanto, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.23": "aññaṃ Saṃgharakkhitaṃ passitvā . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.24": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.25": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.26": "āpatti vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.27": "gottaleso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.28": "Gotamo diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.29": "Moggallāno diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.30": "Kaccāno diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.31": "Vāsiṭṭho diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ ajjhāpajjanto, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.32": "aññaṃ Vāsiṭṭhaṃ passitvā . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.33": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.34": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.35": "vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.36": "liṅgaleso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.37": "dīgho diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.38": "rasso diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.39": "kaṇho diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.40": "odāto diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.41": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.42": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.43": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.44": "vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.45": "āpattileso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.46": "lahukaṃ āpattiṃ ajjhāpajjanto diṭṭho hoti, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.47": "tañ ce pārājikena codeti: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.48": "asamaṇo 'si . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.49": "vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.50": "pattaleso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.51": "lohapattadharo diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.52": "sāṭakapattadharo diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.53": "sumbhakapattadharo diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.54": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.55": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.56": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.57": "vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.58": "cīvaraleso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.59": "paṃsukūliko diṭṭho hoti --pa-- ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.60": "gahapaticīvaradharo diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.61": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.62": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.63": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.64": "vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.65": "upajjhāyaleso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.66": "itthannāmassa saddhivihāriko diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.67": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.68": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.69": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.70": "vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.71": "ācariyaleso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.72": "itthannāmassa antevāsiko diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.73": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.74": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.75": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.76": "vācāya vācāya saṃghādisesassa. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.77": "senāsanaleso nāma: ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.78": "itthannāmasenāsanavāsiko diṭṭho hoti pārājikaṃ dhammaṃ . . . ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.3.79": "",
