  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.4.15": "koci deso lesamatto upādinno 'ti, ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.4.16": "tesaṃ lesānaṃ aññataro leso upādinno hoti. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:2.4.17": "bhikkhu ca dosaṃ . . . ",
